# Title: New ODBC Driver Registered
# ID: 3390fbef-c98d-4bdd-a863-d65ed7c610dd
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-05-23
# Tags: attack.persistence
# Description: Detects the registration of a new ODBC driver.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\ODBC\\ODBCINST.INI\\* AND registry.path:*\\Driver) AND NOT ((registry.path:*\\SQL Server\\* AND registry.data.strings:"%WINDIR%\\System32\\SQLSRV32.dll")) AND NOT (((registry.path:*\\Microsoft Access * AND registry.data.strings:C:\\Progra* AND registry.data.strings:*\\ACEODBC.DLL) OR (registry.path:*\\Microsoft Excel Driver* AND registry.data.strings:C:\\Progra* AND registry.data.strings:*\\ACEODBC.DLL))))
